    return {'status':'PLANNING_ESTIMATE_FROM_ONE_EXPLICIT_NONHELDOUT_PATH','stages':records,'active_only':total(1),'active_and_matched_random_shared_initial':total(2),'assumptions':[f'Every future history has this graph size and {steps+1} frames; actual candidate meshes and native convergence may differ.','Two seeds execute serially in the quoted wall-time estimate; concurrent execution speedup is not assumed.','First-third two-step and middle-third four-step costs are approximated in proportion to measured full-history recurrent steps; fixed optimizer and batching overhead may differ.','Three validation histories are assumed equal in size to the measured path; no validation or test response arrays were opened.','Native FEM generation, acquisition-pool inference, hard-error weighting passes, checkpoint I/O, independent physics gates and final testing are excluded.','All-cold estimate replaces every curriculum epoch by a complete predicted history, with the same registered validation frequency.','This timing exercise cannot establish dataset qualification, convergence, accuracy or total campaign completion time.']} # Make exclusions explicit instead of presenting a synthetic campaign runtime.
